          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>You reach into another creature's timeline and attempt to alter their flow of time. Select a creature within 30 feet. That creature attempts a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell] saving throw against your chronoskimmer DC. The creature takes the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Slow] based on the result of its saving throw.</p>"
